Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,——OP——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:13.92,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}あの日林檎の木の下 共犯で
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.42,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}踏み越えてみた境界線
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.84,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}すぐに black out「あ、お怒りで」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:21.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}追い立てられてこんな次元へ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:22.80,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}俺とした事が
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.22,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}俺如きですら
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:26.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}俺に限っていや、まさかね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:27.81,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}君のせいにした
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:28.93,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}秘密を手にした
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:31.10,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}イチジクの葉が右左
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:33.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}あっという間、目が醒める (woo)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:36.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}かと思えば空に落ちて行く
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:38.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}なんというか やめられぬ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}もうひと齧り again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:41.82,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Falling, falling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:45.20,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}螺旋状に堕ちてゆく摩天楼に
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.70,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}今 falling falling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.91,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}二人ぼっち気づかない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:50.45,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}カーテンコールにも
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:52.75,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}(Yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah) どこまでも
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:56.17,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}(Yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah) この身任せて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:04:01.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}いつの間に傷が埋まってく yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Again, falling, falling
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:18.77,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}螺旋状に堕ちてゆく摩天楼に
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:20.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}今 falling, falling
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:22.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}二人ぼっち気づかない
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.61,0:04:24.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}カーテンコールにも
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.03,0:04:26.45,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}(Yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah) どこまでも
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:29.45,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}(Yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah) この身任せて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:34.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}いつの間に傷が埋まってく yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:37.71,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Woo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:13.92,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}那一天我们在苹果树下成为共犯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.42,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}尝试越过边界线
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.84,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}马上就black out 「你果然生气了」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:21.43,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}被赶到这个次元
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:22.80,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}我怎么能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.22,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}就凭我这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:26.26,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}怎么可能是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:27.81,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}把这归为你的过错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:28.93,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}我得到了秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:31.10,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}用无花果的叶子遮住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:33.65,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}很快就醒来了 (woo)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:36.02,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}却坠入空中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:38.02,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}怎么说呢  停不下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.65,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}再咬一口  again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:41.82,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Falling, falling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:45.20,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}向摩天大楼螺旋坠落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.70,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}现在 falling falling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.91,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}只有两个人  无人能够发现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:50.45,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}即使已经谢幕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:52.75,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}(Yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah) 在任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:56.17,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}(Yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah) 任由自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:04:01.26,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}不知何时  伤口已经痊愈  yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.48,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Again, Falling, falling
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:18.77,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}向摩天大楼螺旋坠落
